' The interaction mode across a handover, two humans in a v1.2 game from the
' start screen (`menu seed 3 start 30 start2 4`: Anna at Paradise Camp, Bob
' at Nob Hill). Anna goes in and takes fight mode, and ends her day there.
' Bob plays his turn and ends it. Anna's next turn starts in speak mode
' (`WaitScene`, then `OnActivateScene`): the log says so.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
menuclick 60,104         ' player one's slot
type Anna
menuclick 250,104        ' player two's slot
type Bob
menuclick 163,54         ' START
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 3
mapclick 110,122         ' Anna into Paradise Camp
wait 60
fight
day                      ' Anna ends day 1 in fight mode: Bob's turn
wait 20
mapclick 19,292          ' Bob into Nob Hill
wait 60
day                      ' Bob ends day 1: Anna again, day 2
wait 30
quit
